      }
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "等等，积分器是什么？",
      "start": 477.973,
      "duration": 2.786,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_039_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_039_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "简单说，就是自动算微积分的工具。物理和工程领域有大量问题最终都要算积分，传统上要么靠人算，要么靠数值方法近似。你注意啊，这个研究的牛的地方在于——它不训练，不调参，纯靠树搜索让AI自主推导物理规律。",
      "start": 481.237,
      "duration": 20.7,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_040_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_040_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这有点反常识啊。现在谁不发个模型，不训练一下？",
      "start": 502.418,
      "duration": 5.137,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_041_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_041_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对吧？所以这个研究有意思。它证明了一件事：AI不一定非要靠大数据大模型才能做科研，有时候巧妙的搜索算法配合基础模型就够了。这对资源有限的研究机构是个福音。",
      "start": 507.981,
      "duration": 14.648,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_042_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_042_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "而且你想，如果AI能自动推导物理规律，那科研自动化的想象空间就大了。以后博士是不是不用熬夜推公式了？",
      "start": 523.099,
      "duration": 10.144,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_043_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_043_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "哈，那估计老板们更开心，效率直接起飞了。但说实话，这个研究现在还在比较早期的阶段，离真正解决复杂科研问题还有距离，但方向是对的。",
      "start": 533.704,
      "duration": 11.47,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_044_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_044_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "行，第二条。Baseten成为Hugging Face Hub的推理服务商了。",
      "start": 545.63,
      "duration": 5.747,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_045_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_045_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这个我得给不太了解的朋友解释一下。Hugging Face你可以理解成AI界的GitHub，开发者把模型放上去，大家下载使用。但下载下来怎么部署呢？怎么让模型稳定运行对外提供服务呢？这就是推理服务的范畴。",
      "start": 551.843,
      "duration": 15.998,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_046_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_046_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "哦，我明白了。Baseten就是专门帮大家解决\"部署\"这个麻烦事的。",
      "start": 568.274,
      "duration": 6.182,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_047_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_047_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，Baseten在推理优化这块做得很好。现在它正式成为Hugging Face Hub的官方推理服务商，意味着开发者在Hugging Face上找到模型之后，可以一键部署到Baseten，不用自己搞服务器、搞运维。这个门槛降低的不是一点半点。",
      "start": 574.863,
      "duration": 17.391,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_048_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_048_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我跟你说，这对中小开发者太友好了。以前你想做个AI产品，光买GPU服务器就要命了，现在直接按调用次数付费，多灵活。",
      "start": 592.724,
      "duration": 10.188,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_049_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_049_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "没错。这就是AI基础设施层越来越成熟的表现。模型层有Hugging Face，推理层有Baseten，框架层有PyTorch，各司其职，整个生态就活了。",
      "start": 603.313,
      "duration": 11.818,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_050_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_050_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那第三条呢？arXiv上有个用提示工程实现AI教学助手个性化的研究。",
      "start": 615.542,
      "duration": 6.705,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_051_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_051_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这个我特别感兴趣，因为它和教育普惠直接相关。你想啊，现在AI辅导已经很常见了，但问题是——每个学生的基础不一样，学习风格不一样，传统的AI助手是\"一刀切\"的，对所有人输出同样的内容。",
      "start": 622.739,
      "duration": 16.085,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_052_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_052_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "对，这种AI我用着就没啥意思，感觉它根本不了解我。",
      "start": 639.275,
      "duration": 4.136,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_053_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_053_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "所以这个研究的价值就在这儿。它不用微调模型，就是通过提示工程的技巧，让AI根据每个学生的实时表现去调整讲解方式、难度、例子。你注意啊，\"无需微调\"四个字特别关键——意味着学校不用花大价钱去训练自己的模型，直接用现成的大模型就能实现个性化辅导。",
      "start": 643.901,
      "duration": 22.18,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_054_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_054_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这对教育资源不均衡的地区简直就是救星啊。你想，偏远山区的孩子也能享受名师级的辅导了？",
      "start": 666.581,
      "duration": 8.011,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_055_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_055_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "没错。而且提示工程的成本极低，边际效应高。一个研究机构开发出一套好的提示模板，可以被全国甚至全世界的学校使用。这就是开源精神的胜利。",
      "start": 675.077,
      "duration": 12.452,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_056_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_056_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我突然觉得，咱们开头说的那句话特别对——AI正在从更大模型的军备竞赛，转向更深落地。今天这五条新闻，科学发现、教育普惠、能源气象、开发者工具，全都是往深里扎的。",
      "start": 688.009,
      "duration": 18.653,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_057_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_057_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你总结得很到位。说白了，AI这个领域已经过了那个\"哇塞它能说话\"的阶段，现在大家关心的是\"它能帮我解决什么问题\"。这是好事，说明行业在成熟。",
      "start": 707.062,
      "duration": 11.363,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_058_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_058_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "行，那今天节目就差不多到这儿了。周航，你最后给听众朋友们一句话总结？",
      "start": 718.903,
      "duration": 7.184,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_059_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_059_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "就一句话吧——AI不是来抢我们饭碗的，是来帮我们端饭碗的。用好它的人，会比不用它的人强很多。",
      "start": 726.55,
      "duration": 7.663,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_060_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_060_lively.mp3"
      },
